{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】日本著名作家村上龍逝世，享年74歲。</p>\n<p>村上龍與村上春樹並稱為「村上雙傑」，共同引領日本文壇村上龍的作品，風格前衛及充滿感官衝擊，代表作包括《接近無限透明的藍》及《寄物櫃的嬰孩》。</p>\n<p>村上龍亦曾經擔任電影導演及編劇，並積極就政經議題發聲，他本月17日在家中逝世，享年74歲。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:44:12.209869+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:28:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:19.879992+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:19.879992+00:00","content_hash":"ede9333493ed0cb78bced009aa0743cba295cc74473f714c92bac141967a3e80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}